        if (demand == "low") {
            finalPrice -= 0.10;
        }
        else {
            finalPrice -= 0.25;
        }
    }
    cout << "The final price is: $" << finalPrice << endl;
    return 0;
}
```
The program starts by defining the base price and initializing the final price to be the same as the base price. It then prompts the user to enter the weather and demand inputs.
